                                "sense_id": "e4ab1177-8bea-30c8-b2d4-27fd33eea56e",
                                "text": "And the righteous men, they shall iudge them after the manner of adulteresses, and after the manner of women that shed blood; because they are adulteresses, and blood is in their handes."
